<view class="page home-page">
  <view class="hero">
    <image class="hero-image" src="/assets/images/hero.webp" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="hero-overlay"></view>
    <view class="hero-copy">
      <text class="hero-kicker">青年红色筑梦之旅 · 创意组</text>
      <text class="hero-title">让农废回到土地，
让乡村长出新价值。</text>
      <text class="hero-desc">以农用酵素连接农业副产物资源化、生态种植、农产品增值与乡村研学。</text>
      <view class="hero-actions">
        <button class="primary-button" bindtap="goProcess">看懂循环方案</button>
        <button class="ghost-button hero-ghost" bindtap="goProducts">查看产品原型</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="keyword-row">
    <text class="pill" wx:for="{{keywords}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section intro">
    <text class="kicker">项目缘起</text>
    <text class="heading">不是再做一个农产品品牌，
而是先重建一条乡村循环。</text>
    <text class="lead">瑞溪村拥有数十年的大棚番茄种植基础。项目把农废处理、农用酵素发酵、生态种植、产品设计与青年实践放进同一套协作机制中。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section cycle-section">
    <view class="section-head-row">
      <view>
        <text class="kicker">循环方案</text>
        <text class="heading light-heading">从田间到餐桌，
再回到土地。</text>
      </view>
      <text class="swipe-tip">左右滑动</text>
    </view>
    <scroll-view class="cycle-scroll" scroll-x="true" enhanced="true" show-scrollbar="false">
      <view class="cycle-list">
        <view class="cycle-card" wx:for="{{cycle}}" wx:key="no">
          <text class="cycle-no">{{item.no}}</text>
          <view class="cycle-mark">{{item.mark}}</view>
          <text class="cycle-title">{{item.title}}</text>
          <text class="cycle-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>
  </view>

  <view class="section quick-section">
    <text class="kicker">继续探索</text>
    <view class="quick-grid">
      <view class="quick-card card" bindtap="goProcess">
        <text class="quick-index">01</text><text class="quick-title">技术底座</text><text class="quick-desc">水解、产酸、后熟三阶段</text>
      </view>
      <view class="quick-card card" bindtap="goProducts">
        <text class="quick-index">02</text><text class="quick-title">产品原型</text><text class="quick-desc">番茄鲜饮与谷物冰淇淋</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
